// ===== Marina Bay Financial Centre (KPF, 2010-13): Tower 1 (186 m, 33 storeys) at the north corner on Marina Boulevard, Tower 2
// (245 m, 50 storeys) on the west corner, Tower 3 (240 m, 46 storeys, stepped crown) at the south corner on Central Boulevard /
// Marina Way, Marina Bay Residences (222 m, 55 storeys) on the bay side and the slender Marina Bay Suites (227 m, 66 storeys)
